BT
/F1 11 Tf
48 792 Td
15 TL
/F1 18 Tf
(AUTHENTICATION AND ACCESS) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Transport: native MCP streamable HTTP.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Authentication: shared bearer token; missing or invalid tokens receive 401.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Encryption: the SSH tunnel encrypts traffic between the Mac and a4000.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Exposure: loopback-only on a4000 by default.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Authorization: every valid token holder receives the same read surface.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(IMPORTANT LIMIT) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(This is shared-secret access, not per-user identity or RBAC. Do not expose) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(the endpoint directly to the public internet. Public deployment would need) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(TLS termination, identity, token rotation, authorization, rate limits,) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(and a separate deployment review.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(USEFUL FIRST CALLS) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(list_lab_devices             List the nine-device lab inventory.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(check_lab_interfaces         Inspect interface status for a device.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(check_lab_bgp_neighbors      Inspect BGP neighbor state.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(check_lab_isis_neighbors     Inspect IS-IS adjacency state.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(assess_lab_device_health     Run deterministic health rules and findings.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(investigate_lab_session      Follow a deterministic BGP, interface,) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(                             IS-IS, or LDP dependency ladder.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(list_lab_tickets             List open tickets; set include_closed=true) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(                             to include completed investigations.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(CLIENT CONFIGURATION PATTERN) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Use the endpoint URL and bearer header required by your MCP client. A) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(representative configuration has an MCP server URL of:) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(   http://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(and an Authorization header sourced from a local secret variable.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
